      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Painful, yes, it hurts in the knee. But I can't tell you when exactly the pain started. I wrote the swelling date, not the pain. I think the pain came first, maybe two days before. Maybe not.",
